OL,3,AWayfair among firms fined millions for
OL,4,Amisleading sales tactics
OL,5,
OL,6,FWayfair is among three firms which have
OL,7,Fbeen fined #6m in total by the
OL,8,Fcompetition watchdog over misleading
OL,9,Fsales tactics ` with some customers set
OL,10,Fto receive refunds.
OL,12,FThe Competition Markets Authority (CMA)
OL,13,Fhas fined the online furniture retailer
OL,14,F#4.8m and electronics retailer
OL,15,FAppliances Direct #1.2m for misleading
OL,16,Fcustomers with time-limited offers.
OL,18,FMeanwhile, Gold's Gym has been fined
OL,19,F#48,000 for not telling customers the
OL,20,Ftotal price of memberships.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
