OL,3,AWayfair among firms fined millions for
OL,4,Amisleading sales tactics
OL,5,
OL,6,FAppliances Direct and Gold's Gym have
OL,7,Fbeen ordered to refund customers a
OL,8,Ftotal of #440,000. The BBC has
OL,9,Fcontacted the three companies for
OL,10,Fcomment.
